{
  "type": "GripSpec",
  "description": "A grip is a VALUE and its `key` is the registry — decode `input` leniently, re-encode, expect `canonical`; `key` pins GripSpec.key of the decoded value. `canonical: null` means the decode must fail (not an object).",
  "cases": [
    {
